rflow/status/2093813162894324009","checkYourself":"look at your own AI client's network traffic: every request re-uploads the whole conversation. That is the cost this removes."},"risks":["early, single-maintainer infrastructure — not a company with a support team","deposit addresses are custodial-style: software this project controls signs for them","TOKEN and LEOS are volatile small-cap tokens; USDC is the clean comparison","payments settle before the model call and are final — no refunds if an upstream errors"],"verifyYourself":{"rateCard":"https://x402-tokens.fly.dev/.well-known/x402.json","models":"https://x402-tokens.fly.dev/v1/models","receipts":"https://x402-tokens.fly.dev/v1/receipts","economics":"https://x402-tokens.fly.dev/v1/usage/summary","liveBoard":"https://openzoo.fun/stats","client":"https://registry.npmjs.org/openzoo"}}